  <ferc:DisclosureOfObligationsIncurredOrAssumedByRespondentAsGuarantorForThePerformanceByAnotherOfAnyAgreementOrObligationTextBlock id="f-17" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-left:18pt;padding-right:18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;6. See note 4 to Schedule 122.1.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfObligationsIncurredOrAssumedByRespondentAsGuarantorForThePerformanceByAnotherOfAnyAgreementOrObligationTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInArticlesOfIncorporationOrAmendmentsToCharterTextBlock id="f-18" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-left:27pt;padding-right:18pt;text-indent:-9pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;7. On April 21, 2025, the limited liability company operating agreement of Venture Global Gator Express, LLC was amended to allow for the appointment of an independent manager that is entitled to approve or consent to certain material decisions of the Company.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInArticlesOfIncorporationOrAmendmentsToCharterTextBlock>
